{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:hybrid-discovery:v6.2:loopback-messages",
  "$anchor": "LoopbackMessage",
  "title": "Authenticated fact-only loopback messages",
  "$comment": "canonical_body_hash = SHA-256(ASCII('HYBRID-DISCOVERY/v6.2/LoopbackBody/v1') || 0x00 || RFC8785_JCS(body)). mac = HMAC-SHA-256(raw_32_byte_pairing_secret, ASCII('HYBRID-DISCOVERY/v6.2/LOOPBACK-HMAC-SHA256/v1') || 0x00 || U32BE(len(UTF8(session_id))) || UTF8(session_id) || U32BE(len(ASCII(direction))) || ASCII(direction) || U64BE(counter) || U32BE(len(ASCII(message_type))) || ASCII(message_type) || raw_32_byte_canonical_body_digest). Counters are independent per direction, start at 1, increment by exactly 1, and reject replay or gaps.",
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ClientToBackendMessage"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/BackendToClientMessage"
    }
  ],
  "$defs": {
